DTSTART:20260914T120033Z
DTEND:20260914T124934Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:34:10 and reappears at 18:16:17 IST\, se
 en from Nagpur.\nThe Moon is 31° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +9°.\nTi
 mes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's
  edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Nagpur
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Nagpur
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
